  "prefLabel": "Ph 2501.02 Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 2501.02 Scope. These rules shall apply to the placement of automated pharmacy systems in community remote sites, hospitals, and emergency drug kits, for the purpose of storage and dispensing of controlled and non-controlled prescription drugs.\n\nSource. #13465, eff 12-19-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ph100-2600.html"
